---
layout: base.njk
title: FinalShell 技术文章与教程列表
description: FinalShell SSH 连接、会话管理、文件传输、服务器运维与安装配置文章列表。
permalink: /blog/
---
<section class="block">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="block-head">
      <h1>FinalShell 技术文章与教程列表</h1>
      <p>下方「核心教程」优先收录；带时间戳的参考文默认不进入搜索引擎索引。</p>
    </header>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:20px;">核心教程（可索引）</h2>
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for post in collections.indexablePosts %}
        <article class="list-card">
          {% set hero = post.data.coverImage or post.data.heroImage %}
          {% if hero %}
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">
              <img src="{{ hero | assetUrl }}" alt="{{ post.data.heroAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
            </a>
          {% endif %}
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | readableDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <h2 style="margin:48px 0 20px;">全部参考文章</h2>
    <div class="list-grid">
      {% for post in collections.posts %}
        {% if post.data.generated %}
        <article class="list-card">
          {% if post.data.heroImage %}
            <a href="{{ post.url }}">
              <img src="{{ post.data.heroImage | assetUrl }}" alt="{{ post.data.heroAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
            </a>
          {% endif %}
          <time datetime="{{ post.date | readableDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
